  B5 medium moving at beta = v/c through the cosmic chibar(x0): h^mn d chibar d chibar = -beta**2*chi_p**2/(beta**2 - 1)  -> u_v = gamma beta |chibar'|
  B5 FRW machinery: u^2 at O(eps^2) = (K_m**2*Derivative(eta(x0, x), x0)**2 + K_m**2*Derivative(xi(x0, x), x0)**2 - 6*K_m*h*exp(h*x0)*Derivative(dchi(x0, x), x)*Derivative(xi(x0, x), x0) + 9*h**2*exp(2*h*x0)*Derivative(dchi(x0, x), x)**2)*exp(-4*h*x0)/(9*h**2)
